      "chineseAliases": [
        "安排不太靠谱",
        "安排没把握",
        "前景不确定"
      ],
      "englishForms": [
        "iffier",
        "iffiest"
      ],
      "en": "The outdoor concert is looking iffy now that heavy rain is forecast.",
      "zh": "现在预报会下大雨，这场户外音乐会能否举行还没把握。",
      "references": [
